sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Browser as Browser (React)
  participant API as FastAPI (customer360.api)
  participant DB as SQLite warehouse
  participant LLM as LLM (Bedrock / OpenAI-compatible)

  Note over Browser,DB: Read path — lists, profile, portfolio, admin
  Browser->>API: GET /api/... (customers, overview, detail)
  API->>DB: SQL (dims, facts, APP_* caches, churn scores)
  DB-->>API: Result sets / JSON aggregates
  API-->>Browser: JSON response

  Note over Browser,LLM: AI Insights — customer detail (SSE)
  Browser->>API: GET .../insights/stream?locale=&refresh=
  API->>DB: load_customer_context(customer_id)
  DB-->>API: Consolidated snapshot + churn tier
  API->>LLM: stream (system + user prompt, ui locale)
  loop SSE deltas
    LLM-->>API: token chunks
    API-->>Browser: event: delta
  end
  API-->>Browser: event: done (summary, recommendations, …)

  Note over Browser,LLM: Retention queue — playbook sidebar (SSE)
  Browser->>API: POST .../playbooks/retention/recommendations/stream
  API->>DB: compact customer snapshot
  API->>LLM: stream JSON title + detail (locale)
  LLM-->>API: chunks
  API-->>Browser: delta / done per customer_id

  Note over Browser,LLM: Executive assistant (SSE)
  Browser->>API: POST /api/agent/ask/stream { message, locale, segment }
  API->>DB: tools / context (book, list, rules fallback)
  API->>LLM: stream answer JSON (locale)
  LLM-->>API: chunks
  API-->>Browser: delta / done (answer, actions)

  Note over Browser,LLM: Outreach draft from insight (SSE)
  Browser->>API: POST .../insights/action-draft/stream { locale }
  API->>DB: customer + recommendation context
  API->>LLM: draft email / SMS / call script
  LLM-->>API: chunks
  API-->>Browser: delta / done (subject, body, channel)
